  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b313f25ec16c9774591111cbd86271e4, type: 3}
  m_Name: PriceList
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DeepWater.Aviator::DeepWater.Aviator.ScriptableObjects.PriceListSO
  jet: 1000
  friendlyKillPenalty: 500
  round: 0.5
  heatMissile: 50
  radarMissile: 120
  chaff: 3
  flare: 3
  fuelPerKg: 0.02
  provenance: 'A23 (SIX 2026-10-30: "a price tag on every bullet and missile, friendly
    kill, enemy kill, death, fuel"; shown on the scoreboard first, the reward later
    on SIX''s go). Game credits, every number AUTHORED, none a real-world price (BLUEPRINT
    standing constraint 8). jet 1000: what an enemy kill earns and what losing your
    own costs, however it went down. friendlyKillPenalty 500 on top of the jet the
    side lost. Scaled so one kill pays for a whole sortie: round 0.5 (the full 412
    rounds 206), heatMissile 50, radarMissile 120 (the long shot dearer), chaff 3
    and flare 3 (all 30 of each 90), fuelPerKg 0.02 (a full tank of about 6,500 kg
    is 130). Radar time and IFF questions are free.'
